-The user rejected extra book sorting and selected closing reset followed by dynamic patrol. RF-02-2 restores two reading chairs and manually parks the return cart. RF-02-3 adds a random failed retaining rail, one immediate fall and another every 12 simulation seconds while unrepaired, capped at three. Repair halts new drops, and all already-fallen books remain required. No global countdown, terminal clues or step navigation.
